          "targetDoi": "10.3758/s13428-020-01364-w",
          "snippet": "Like some of the more modern versions of the MATB such as the TSU-MATB or OpenMATB platforms (Cegarra et al,  2020  ; Thanoon et al,  2017  ), the USAARL MATB includes options by which operators can be provided with live performance feedback. With that being said, the USAARL MATB's primary feedback option is somewhat different from those in the TSU-MATB or OpenMATB in that they are intended to be used, at least in some cases, as a cue to enable automation.",
