          "snippet": "To address this research question, the current study examines multitasking behavior in a standardized test environment using a modi ed version of the Multi-Attribute Task Battery (openMATB) [17], originally developed by Comstock &amp; Arnegard [18]. The MATB traditionally comprises four ight-relevant tasks a tracking task, a system monitoring task, a communication task, and a resource management task.",
